            "explanation": "The answer is 0.75 cm s–1\nFrom the graph, period T = 2.0 s\nUsing the relationship between frequency f and period T :\nSo, using\nspeed  =  frequency  ×  wavelength\nwe get\nspeed  =  0.50  × 1.5  =  0.75 cm s–1",
