            "explanation": "Momentum p is given by:\nrearranging this gives:\nand because kinetic energy (KE) is given by:\nwe can find another expression for kinetic energy:\nThis expression for kinetic energy allows us to use the information given to calculate a value for the mass:\nand so the answer is 3 kg.\nFinally, it is good practice to verify this answer by substituting it back into the kinetic energy equation:\nwhich is as expected.",
