            "explanation": "The answer is\nThe initial kinetic energy of the lorry is given by\nAs the lorry is moving along a horizontal road, the resistive forces need to convert all this initial kinetic energy and no more. We know that the work done by the resistive force must be \"resistive force (F) × distance\", so we can write:\nF × distance  =\nand we can rearrange this to find the distance required:\ndistance",
